JasprMutants - Mutant Creatures Legacy on JasperCraft (Paper 1.12.2)

This plugin contains the source code of Mutant Creatures Legacy (mod id "mutantbeasts", Forge 1.12.2,
mod version 1.0.4, https://github.com/Elite-Modding-Team/MutantCreaturesLegacy) by ACGaming, IcarussOne and
PessiMysterio (Elite Modding Team) - original mod by shcott21/thehippomaster21, initial port by Chumbanotz -
licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License version 3 (see LICENSE). The whole plugin is
distributed under the same licence.

Origin of the files:
- src/chumbanotz/mutantbeasts/...: the mod's common (server-side) classes, copied unchanged except where
  Paper cannot run Forge code; every such change is marked "// JasperCraft port: <why>" in the source and
  listed in PORT_NOTES.md. Client-only classes (rendering, models, GUI, particles) are not part of this
  server plugin; the client stage JASPR_MUTANTS ports them.
- resources/assets/mutantbeasts/{loot_tables,recipes,advancements,lang}: the mod's data files, unchanged.
- src/net/minecraftforge/...: a JasperCraft shim with the subset of the Forge/FML API this mod uses,
  written for this port (same API shape, Forge 1.12.2 behaviour, see the class comments).
- src/chat/jaspr/mutants/...: JasperCraft glue (Paper registries, entity tracking and spawn message,
  plugin channels, Bukkit event bridges, natural spawning, loot tables, recipes, brewing, advancements,
  configuration, API for other plugins).

Not included: the newer Mutant Skeleton sounds (sounds/entity/mutant_skeleton/*.ogg outside legacy/) are
All Rights Reserved (the mod's LICENSE_ASSETS); this port defaults to the mod's legacy skeleton sounds.

Players can obtain the complete corresponding source of this plugin from the JasperCraft repository
(server/custom-plugins/JasprMutants) as required by AGPL-3.0 section 13.
